> **Every Phylactery replica, including constrained partial replicas, must contain sufficient surviving primitives, provenance, topology, and recovery machinery to reconstruct the state it does not locally contain, subject only to external realities that no stored artifact can guarantee.**

That makes a phone/tablet partial fundamentally different from “some important files.” It is a **self-describing recovery nucleus**.

